The board schematic and manual PDFs are not included in this repository.

RTL8201F
--------
The RTL8201F MII/RMII strap and register information is from the Realtek
RTL8201F datasheet (Rev. 0.91).  The datasheet is not included in this
repository; obtain it from Realtek or an authorized distributor.

